data: {"sequence_number": 354, "type": "response.output_item.added", "item": {"id": "rs_8a4c57f0-1d48-928d-8eeb-e33d10a2260d", "summary": [], "type": "reasoning", "status": "in_progress"}, "output_index": 14}

event: response.output_text.done
data: {"sequence_number": 355, "type": "response.output_text.done", "content_index": 0, "item_id": "msg_8a4c57f0-1d48-928d-8eeb-e33d10a2260d", "output_index": 13, "text": "**Python 3.15.0**，发布日期为 **2026 年 10 月 9 日**（Oct. 9, 2026）。这是当前最新的稳定（stable/final）版本。[[1]](https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/)[[2]](https://www.python.org/downloads/macos/)\n\n官方证据（直接来自 python.org）：\n- Python Insider 官方博客标题为“Python 3.15.0 (final) is here!”，由发布经理 Hugo van Kemenade 于 2026 年 10 月 9 日发布，明确说明“This is the stable release of Python 3.15.0”，并链接至发布页面 https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3150/。[[1]](https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/)[[1]](https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/)\n- https://www.python.org/downloads/ 和 macOS 下载页面将“Latest Python 3 Release - Python 3.15.0”列为最新，标注日期为 Oct. 9, 2026。[[2]](https://www.python.org/downloads/macos/)\n- Python 开发者指南（devguide.python.org/versions/）确认 3.15 分支首次发布于 2026-10-09，目前处于 bugfix 阶段；3.16 目前仅为 alpha 1（2026-10-13 发布），非稳定版。[[3]](https://devguide.python.org/versions/)\n\nPython 3.14.8 等为旧分支的维护更新，不是最新稳定主要版本。推荐直接查阅 https://www.python.org/downloads/ 和 https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/ 获取最新确认。", "logprobs": []}

event: response.content_part.done
data: {"sequence_number": 356, "type": "response.content_part.done", "content_index": 0, "item_id": "msg_8a4c57f0-1d48-928d-8eeb-e33d10a2260d", "output_index": 13, "part": {"type": "output_text", "text": "**Python 3.15.0**，发布日期为 **2026 年 10 月 9 日**（Oct. 9, 2026）。这是当前最新的稳定（stable/final）版本。[[1]](https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/)[[2]](https://www.python.org/downloads/macos/)\n\n官方证据（直接来自 python.org）：\n- Python Insider 官方博客标题为“Python 3.15.0 (final) is here!”，由发布经理 Hugo van Kemenade 于 2026 年 10 月 9 日发布，明确说明“This is the stable release of Python 3.15.0”，并链接至发布页面 https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3150/。[[1]](https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/)[[1]](https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/)\n- https://www.python.org/downloads/ 和 macOS 下载页面将“Latest Python 3 Release - Python 3.15.0”列为最新，标注日期为 Oct. 9, 2026。[[2]](https://www.python.org/downloads/macos/)\n- Python 开发者指南（devguide.python.org/versions/）确认 3.15 分支首次发布于 2026-10-09，目前处于 bugfix 阶段；3.16 目前仅为 alpha 1（2026-10-13 发布），非稳定版。[[3]](https://devguide.python.org/versions/)\n\nPython 3.14.8 等为旧分支的维护更新，不是最新稳定主要版本。推荐直接查阅 https://www.python.org/downloads/ 和 https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/ 获取最新确认。", "logprobs": [], "annotations": [{"type": "url_citation", "url": "https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/", "start_index": 84, "end_index": 149, "title": "1"}, {"type": "url_citation", "url": "https://www.python.org/downloads/macos/", "start_index": 149, "end_index": 195, "title": "2"}, {"type": "url_citation", "url": "https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/", "start_index": 434, "end_index": 499, "title": "1"}, {"type": "url_citation", "url": "https://blog.python.org/2026/10/python-3150-final-is-here/", "start_index": 499, "end_index": 564, "title": "1"}, {"type": "url_citation", "url": "https://www.python.org/downloads/macos/", "start_index": 679, "end_index": 725, "title": "2"}, {"type": "url_citation", "url": "https://devguide.python.org/versions/", "start_index": 851, "end_index": 895, "title": "3"}]}}

